  "details": "On 15/08/2025, when I logged into VRChat, I was met with a Terms of Service “Accept” prompt. However, the entire Terms of Service text box was completely empty.\n\nAfter waiting around 4 - 5 mins, I had no choice but to click Accept\n\nThis is a serious issue because:\n\nUsers are being asked to agree to blank Terms of Service.\n\nThis could create potential legal and compliance problems, as technically users are “accepting” no terms at all.\n\nOther users have reported experiencing the same bug.\n\nThe Terms of Service text should always load and display correctly before a user can click “Accept.”",
